nt_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710832012:0":{"text":"奴です！……裏切り者のディアグレスが、王宮に押し入って……","source_cn":"那个叛徒！迪尔格雷！他、他强行闯入了王宫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EBA4DACD49A3AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710832013:1":{"text":"数十名の守備軍をなぎ倒し――","source_cn":"他打伤了几十名守备军同僚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB26A8D4F1B0AFC75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710832014:1":{"text":"国王陛下の寝殿へ向かって行きました！","source_cn":"正朝着国王陛下的寝殿去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDD85C90A790021B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710832015:1":{"text":"あなたとローランドの顔に緊張が走る。国王は今、命の瀬戸際にあるのだ。","source_cn":"你和罗兰的心猛地一沉。你们比谁都清楚——国王正处于生命...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCCAC47804B74F34C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あなたとローランドの顔に緊張が走る。国王は今、命の瀬戸際にあるのだ。","female":"あなたとローランドの顔に緊張が走る。国王は今、命の瀬戸際にあるのだ。","variant_male_record_index":"225878","variant_female_record_index":"225879","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710832016:1":{"text":"そして王妃は、象意予見とアウロラへの協力で力を使い果たしている。","source_cn":"而王后，在连续使用了意象预视和协助奥罗菈之后，也已精疲力竭！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74D03F56131B8D99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710832017:1":{"text":"父上、母上……！今すぐ戻らないと！","source_cn":"父王！母后！我得回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB19CD46854723C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1710832018:1":{"text":"ペギーがとっさに駆け出したが、ローランドが手を伸ばして制した。","source_cn":"佩吉几乎是本能地就要向王宫冲去，但被罗兰伸手拦住。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66090C8AC47CD710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1710832019:1":{"text":"ディアグレスがいる王宮に、ペギーを行かせるわけにはいかない。","source_cn":"你们很清楚，现在情况危急，佩吉绝不能返回王宫！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC928E47CD16FF431","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ディアグレスがいる王宮に、ペギーを行かせるわけにはいかない。","female":"ディアグレスがいる王宮に、ペギーを行かせるわけにはいかない。","variant_male_record_index":"225883","variant_female_record_index":"225884","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1710832020:1":{"text":"あなたはローランドと視線を交わし、無言のまま互いに小さくうなずいた。","source_cn":"你与罗兰对视一眼，默契地互相点了点头。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x41F584EEB8C083DF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あなたはローランドと視線を交わし、無言のまま互いに小さくうなずいた。","female":"あなたはローランドと視線を交わし、無言のまま互いに小さくうなずいた。","variant_male_record_index":"225885","variant_female_record_index":"225886","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1710832021:0":{"text":"ここからは手分けして動こう！","source_cn":"我们必须分头行动！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x062F218EF38D3B8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1710832022:0":{"text":"マーリン、君は直ちに王宮へ向かえ！","source_cn":"梅林，你立刻回援王宫！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4562016D76C0CC4A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マーリン、君は直ちに王宮へ向かえ！","female":"マーリン、君は直ちに王宮へ向かえ！","variant_male_record_index":"225888","variant_female_record_index":"225889","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1710832023:1":{"text":"君の魔法に敵う者はいない。奴が守衛たちを突破する前に、何としてでも阻止するんだ！","source_cn":"你的魔法是最厉害的——只有你能在他得手前穿过防线，拦截住他！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB3332E897E28CD4C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"君の魔法に敵う者はいない。奴が守衛たちを突破する前に、何としてでも阻止するんだ！","female":"君の魔法に敵う者はいない。奴が守衛たちを突破する前に、何としてでも阻止するんだ！","variant_male_record_index":"225890","variant_female_record_index":"225891","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1710832024:1":{"text":"いや！私も行きます！だって、父上と母上が……！","source_cn":"不！我也要去！他们是我的父母！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD691B39F8B75F1F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1710832025:0":{"text":"君の戦場はここだ、ペギー姫！","source_cn":"你的战斗在这里，公主！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE665691A0A52EE2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1710832026:0":{"text":"私とカスティーは、魔物を生み出している裂目を閉じなければならない！","source_cn":"裂隙是灾难的源头！我和科丝蒂必须集中力量关闭它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3D16E9229BA18F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1710832027:0":{"text":"だが、いったん始めれば、私たちは無防備になる……","source_cn":"但是，一旦开始，我们两人都会毫无防备……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x028F6AFBB72C7BF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1710832028:0":{"text":"ヘンドリックは民を守り、マーリンは国王を救いに行かなくてはならない。ここには私たちを守る者が必要だ！","source_cn":"亨德里克在保护民众，梅林必须去救国王！而我们，需要一个...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x75FEF4849ACB27EF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ヘンドリックは民を守り、マーリンは国王を救いに行かなくてはならない。ここには私たちを守る者が必要だ！","female":"ヘンドリックは民を守り、マーリンは国王を救いに行かなくてはならない。ここには私たちを守る者が必要だ！","variant_male_record_index":"225896","variant_female_record_index":"225897","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1710832029:0":{"text":"兄のように、逃げたくないのだろう？","source_cn":"你的哥哥逃了。现在，你要逃吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E8470BD4CE4A480","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1710832030:0":{"text":"ならば君の務めは、ここに残り、私たちと――","source_cn":"还是……你要留在这里，守护我们——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7409BF9C0B834D70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":"